{"id":"9c8f0dba-8056-4265-96a3-fea33da19c01","createdAt":"2026-10-25T05:14:53.420Z","batchId":"login_qwen3-8-max-opencode-go_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-max-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .login-wrap{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;min-height:100vh;padding:48px 16px;box-sizing:border-box}\n  .login-card{width:100%;max-width:400px;padding:28px}\n  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px}\n  .brand-dot{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#8b5cf6);flex:none}\n  .pw-row{position:relative}\n  .pw-toggle{position:absolute;top:50%;right:10px;transform:translateY(-50%);border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;padding:2px 4px}\n  .field-error{color:#ef4444;font-size:13px;margin-top:4px;display:none}\n  .field-error.show{display:block}\n  input.invalid{border-color:#ef4444}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"login-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"card login-card\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <div class=\"brand-dot\"></div>\n      <div>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0\">Acme Cloud</h2>\n        <span class=\"muted small\">Sign in to your account</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\" id=\"login-stack\">\n      <form id=\"login-form\" novalidate>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <label for=\"email\">Email address\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n          </label>\n          <div class=\"field-error\" id=\"email-error\">Please enter a valid email address.</div>\n\n          <label for=\"password\">Password\n            <div class=\"pw-row\">\n              <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" required>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"pw-toggle muted\" id=\"pw-toggle\" aria-label=\"Show or hide password\">Show</button>\n            </div>\n          </label>\n          <div class=\"field-error\" id=\"password-error\">Password must be at least 8 characters.</div>\n\n          <div class=\"row between\">\n            <label class=\"check\" style=\"margin:0\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember\" name=\"remember\">\n              <span class=\"small\">Remember me for 30 days</span>\n            </label>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"small\">Forgot password?</a>\n          </div>\n\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block btn-lg\" id=\"submit-btn\">Sign in</button>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n\n      <hr>\n      <p class=\"muted small center\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:0\">\n        Don't have an account? <a href=\"#\">Contact your administrator</a>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  (function(){\n    var pw = document.getElementById('password');\n    var toggle = document.getElementById('pw-toggle');\n    toggle.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      var hidden = pw.type === 'password';\n      pw.type = hidden ? 'text' : 'password';\n      toggle.textContent = hidden ? 'Hide' : 'Show';\n    });\n\n    var form = document.getElementById('login-form');\n    var email = document.getElementById('email');\n    var emailErr = document.getElementById('email-error');\n    var pwErr = document.getElementById('password-error');\n    var btn = document.getElementById('submit-btn');\n\n    function validateEmail(){\n      var ok = /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email.value.trim());\n      email.classList.toggle('invalid', !ok);\n      emailErr.classList.toggle('show', !ok);\n      return ok;\n    }\n    function validatePassword(){\n      var ok = pw.value.length >= 8;\n      pw.classList.toggle('invalid', !ok);\n      pwErr.classList.toggle('show', !ok);\n      return ok;\n    }\n    email.addEventListener('blur', validateEmail);\n    pw.addEventListener('blur', validatePassword);\n\n    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){\n      e.preventDefault();\n      var okE = validateEmail(), okP = validatePassword();\n      if (!okE || !okP) return;\n      btn.disabled = true;\n      btn.textContent = 'Signing in…';\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        btn.disabled = false;\n        btn.textContent = 'Sign in';\n        alert('Signed in as ' + email.value.trim() +\n          (document.getElementById('remember').checked ? ' (session remembered for 30 days).' : '.'));\n      }, 900);\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[25344,"<style>\n  .login-wrap{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;min-height:100vh;padding:48px 16px;box-sizing:border-box}\n  .login-card{width:100%;max-width:400px;padding:28px}\n  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px}\n  .brand-dot{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#8b5cf6);flex:none}\n  .pw-row{position:relative}\n  .pw-toggle{position:absolute;top:50%;right:10px;transform:translateY(-50%);border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;padding:2px 4px}\n  .field-error{color:#ef4444;font-size:13px;margin-top:4px;display:none}\n  .field-error.show{display:block}\n  input.invalid{border-color:#ef4444}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"login-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"card login-card\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <div class=\"brand-dot\"></div>\n      <div>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0\">Acme Cloud</h2>\n        <span class=\"muted small\">Sign in to your account</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\" id=\"login-stack\">\n      <form id=\"login-form\" novalidate>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <label for=\"email\">Email address\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n          </label>\n          <div class=\"field-error\" id=\"email-error\">Please enter a valid email address.</div>\n\n          <label for=\"password\">Password\n            <div class=\"pw-row\">\n              <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" required>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"pw-toggle muted\" id=\"pw-toggle\" aria-label=\"Show or hide password\">Show</button>\n            </div>\n          </label>\n          <div class=\"field-error\" id=\"password-error\">Password must be at least 8 characters.</div>\n\n          <div class=\"row between\">\n            <label class=\"check\" style=\"margin:0\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember\" name=\"remember\">\n              <span class=\"small\">Remember me for 30 days</span>\n            </label>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"small\">Forgot password?</a>\n          </div>\n\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block btn-lg\" id=\"submit-btn\">Sign in</button>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n\n      <hr>\n      <p class=\"muted small center\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:0\">\n        Don't have an account? <a href=\"#\">Contact your administrator</a>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  (function(){\n    var pw = document.getElementById('password');\n    var toggle = document.getElementById('pw-toggle');\n    toggle.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      var hidden = pw.type === 'password';\n      pw.type = hidden ? 'text' : 'password';\n      toggle.textContent = hidden ? 'Hide' : 'Show';\n    });\n\n    var form = document.getElementById('login-form');\n    var email = document.getElementById('email');\n    var emailErr = document.getElementById('email-error');\n    var pwErr = document.getElementById('password-error');\n    var btn = document.getElementById('submit-btn');\n\n    function validateEmail(){\n      var ok = /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email.value.trim());\n      email.classList.toggle('invalid', !ok);\n      emailErr.classList.toggle('show', !ok);\n      return ok;\n    }\n    function validatePassword(){\n      var ok = pw.value.length >= 8;\n      pw.classList.toggle('invalid', !ok);\n      pwErr.classList.toggle('show', !ok);\n      return ok;\n    }\n    email.addEventListener('blur', validateEmail);\n    pw.addEventListener('blur', validatePassword);\n\n    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){\n      e.preventDefault();\n      var okE = validateEmail(), okP = validatePassword();\n      if (!okE || !okP) return;\n      btn.disabled = true;\n      btn.textContent = 'Signing in…';\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        btn.disabled = false;\n        btn.textContent = 'Sign in';\n        alert('Signed in as ' + email.value.trim() +\n          (document.getElementById('remember').checked ? ' (session remembered for 30 days).' : '.'));\n      }, 900);\n    });\n  })();\n</script>"]],"metrics":{"ttftMs":25343.34490500018,"ttfrMs":25344.380889000022,"totalMs":25402.326125000138,"inputTokens":null,"outputTokens":null,"outputChars":4098,"fidelity":1,"costUsd":null,"valid":true,"errorCount":0,"errors":[],"aborted":false}}